    "content_sha256": "13f9312c5cb8528b996049ea5e3e2604f80b6b2bd1b213166f9ac9eb5b65dfad",
    "template": "{#- Code2Tag: the tags of a problem from its solution alone. Approved before the first request and never edited after it (docs/adr/0003). The text copies the style of the authors' APR and program-synthesis templates, names no focus tag and sets no prior on the number of tags. lang_cluster is the constant LANGUAGE of settings.py, not the dataset's column; all_tags is config.ALL_TAGS. -#}\nPredict the tags of a programming problem given a program written in {{ lang_cluster }} language to solve it.\n\nHere is the code:\n\n{{ source_code }}\n\nChoose the tags from this list: {{ all_tags | join(\", \") }}\n\nProvide the tags of the problem, separated by commas, without any description or extra tokens.\n",
